13634      data drugs; call streaminit(193); length Drug $6 Gender $1 Diabetes2 $3; do ID=1 to 200; Age=20+mod(id*7,45); BMI=20+mod(id,12); if mod(id,2) then
13634    ! Gender='F'; else Gender='M'; if rand('bernoulli',0.5) then Drug='Drug_A'; else Drug='Drug_B'; if rand('bernoulli',0.3+0.1*(Drug='Drug_A')) then
13634    ! Diabetes2='Yes'; else Diabetes2='No'; output; end; run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DRUGS has 200 observations and 6 variables.

